A '''Drowned Captain''' is an {{Epic}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished in [[Water]] on the {{Zone|Lotus Atoll}}.

== Spawning ==
A '''Drowned Captain''' can be fished up anywhere on the {{Zone|Lotus Atoll}} once the player is {{skill|fishing|10}}. 

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for '''Drowned Captain''' is {{Green|500}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|5%|1|20|sea creatures}} with all [[Sea Creatures]] unlocked.

